<body>
  <main class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <small>Effective Date: <strong>January 1, 2026</strong></small>

      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>Translator Pro+</strong>.
        Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is handled when you use our app.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Translator Pro+</strong> does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or share personal information such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name, email address, or contact details</li>
        <li>Account credentials or passwords</li>
        <li>Device identifiers or precise location data</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Voice, Camera, and Text Data</h2>
      <p>
        Translator Pro+ allows translation using text, voice input, and camera images.
        Any text, speech, or images you provide are used <strong>only temporarily</strong> to perform the requested translation.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do <strong>not</strong> store, save, or log your translations on our servers.
        Processing may occur locally on your device or through trusted translation services strictly for providing the translation result.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        The app may request the following permissions only when needed:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Microphone</strong> – for voice translation</li>
        <li><strong>Camera</strong> – for image and camera-based translation</li>
        <li><strong>Photo Library</strong> – to select images for translation</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These permissions are used solely for their intended features and are never accessed without your action.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
      <p>
        Translator Pro+ does not maintain user accounts or personal databases.
        Translation history, if enabled, is stored locally on your device and remains under your control.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        The app may use third-party translation services to provide accurate translations.
        These services process text only to return translation results and do not receive personal user identity information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Children’s Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Translator Pro+ does not knowingly collect data from children under the age of 13.
        The app is safe to use without providing personal information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
        Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:
        <br>
        <a href="mailto:support@translatorproplus.app">support@translatorproplus.app</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      Translator Pro+
    </footer>
  </main>
